THE ANCHORAGE GROUP 
Tagline: Empowering Innovation. Driving Sustainable Growth.
The Anchorage Group is a dynamic Malawian conglomerate that has been shaping industries since its establishment in 2019. From humble beginnings, we have evolved into a trailblazer, championing innovation, sustainability, and strategic excellence across diverse sectors.
A Multifaceted Portfolio
As the parent company of The Anchorage Autoshop, The Anchorage Communications, The Anchorage Motors, The Anchorage Logistics, The Anchorage Agritech, The Anchorage Paye, The Anchorage Voyages, and The Anchorage Outlet, we take pride in our ability to bridge multiple industries through a shared commitment to quality, creativity, and transformative impact. 
Each subsidiary is a pillar of expertise in its own domain, yet all are unified by one vision: to deliver innovative, practical, and results driven solutions that empower individuals, businesses, and communities.
Vision: To be Africa’s most trusted provider of sustainable and customized solutions; empowering growth through innovation, technology, and partnerships that enhances livelihoods and promotes environmental stewardship.
Mission: To harness the collective expertise of our diverse subsidiaries to deliver impactful, innovative, and sustainable solutions across various sectors. We strive to transform challenges into opportunities. We are dedicated to supporting Malawi’s development journey by connecting people, ideas, and resources that create lasting value for businesses, communities, and the planet.
CORE SERVICES
CONSULTANCY SERVICES
At The Anchorage Group, consultancy is not just a service; it is a partnership in innovation and impact. We provide specialized consultancy across key sectors including Research and Project Management, ICT and Information Management Systems, Media, Education, Procurement and Supply, Health, and Development Consulting.
Our consultancy framework is rooted in innovation, integrity, and evidence based solutions. From conceptualization to execution, we ensure rigorous research, strategic thinking, and a deep understanding of local and global dynamics guide every project.
Our team comprises of experts from diverse backgrounds who bring together technical expertise, creativity, and strategic insight to deliver measurable and sustainable outcomes.
SUSTAINABLE AGRICULTURE: OUR AFLASAFE PARTNERSHIP
As the official authorized distributor of Aflasafe in Malawi, The Anchorage Group is committed to advancing food safety, agricultural resilience, and farmer prosperity.
Aflasafe is a revolutionary, environmentally friendly biocontrol product developed by the International Institute of Tropical Agriculture (IITA), to reduce aflatoxin contamination in crops such as maize, sorghum and groundnuts. Through our subsidiary, The Anchorage Agritech, we work hand in hand with farmers, cooperatives, and development partners to ensure wide adoption of Aflasafe and promote sustainable farming systems across Malawi.
Our mission is clear:
•	To protect human health by ensuring safe, aflatoxin free food.
•	To empower farmers with innovative solutions that increase yield and market access.
•	To safeguard the environment through nature based technologies that promote soil and crop health.
Beyond product distribution, we provide training, technical support, and awareness programs to farmers and agribusinesses, ensuring the long term sustainability of Malawi’s agricultural value chains.
Why Choose The Anchorage Group?
As the authorized Aflasafe distributor in Malawi, we play a pivotal role in ensuring food safety, healthier communities, and export ready crops. Guided by innovation at our core, we think beyond boundaries to design solutions that meet today’s challenges and stand the test of time. Backed by multidisciplinary expertise, our portfolio seamlessly connects industries to create holistic, forward thinking solutions. Above all, we are driven by sustainability: every project we undertake is crafted to uplift people, protect the planet, and build lasting prosperity.At The Anchorage Group, we are not just consultants or distributors; we are partners in progress, empowering Malawi and Africa to thrive sustainably in a changing world.
